| `toolchain_python` | string | `3.11` | a release of two or three ASCII-digit parts, such as `3.12`, that satisfies `backend_python` | copier, rendering `config/project.json` `toolchain.python` | Changes the Python the project's CI installs. Its validator refuses a release `backend_python` does not allow, and a `backend_python` clause it cannot judge, before any file is written. | the minimum Python the project supports: `backend_python` | always |
